{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>At this set time in the next year.</b> Rav Huna said in the name of Rav Idi: that year was a leap year. The explanation: from one set time to the next is one year, and He calls it 'the next year' because of the intercalary month that was added to it."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:30.335510676Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}